{"headword":"רְכוּשׁ","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>n.m.</strong> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 13\" href=\"/Genesis.13\">Gn 13</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 6\" href=\"/Genesis.6\">6</a> <strong>property, goods</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">רְכוּשׁ</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 16:32\" href=\"/Numbers.16.32\">Nu 16:32</a> +, <span dir=\"rtl\">רְכֻשׁ</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 14:16\" href=\"/Genesis.14.16\">Gn 14:16</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 14:21\" href=\"/Genesis.14.21\">21</a>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">רְכוּשׁ</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 35:7\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.35.7\">2 Ch 35:7</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">רְכֻשׁ</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 14:11\" href=\"/Genesis.14.11\">Gn 14:11</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">רְכֻשׁוֹ</span> v <a data-ref=\"Genesis 14:12\" href=\"/Genesis.14.12\">12</a> +, <span dir=\"rtl\">רְכוּשָׁם</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 12:5\" href=\"/Genesis.12.5\">12:5</a> +, etc.;—<em>property, goods</em>, PRChr Dn <a data-ref=\"Genesis 14\" href=\"/Genesis.14\">Gn 14</a>:"},{"senses":[{"definition":"gen. term for movable possessions of all kinds (often specif. incl. cattle), <a data-ref=\"Genesis 12:5\" href=\"/Genesis.12.5\">Gn 12:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 15:14\" href=\"/Genesis.15.14\">15:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 16:32\" href=\"/Numbers.16.32\">Nu 16:32</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 27:31\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.27.31\">1 Ch 27:31</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 28:1\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.28.1\">28:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 31:3\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.31.3\">2 Ch 31:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 32:29\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.32.29\">32:29</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezra 8:21\" href=\"/Ezra.8.21\">Ezr 8:21</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezra 10:8\" href=\"/Ezra.10.8\">10:8</a>."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"used specif. of cattle, flocks, etc. <a data-ref=\"Genesis 13:6\" href=\"/Genesis.13.6\">Gn 13:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 31:18\" href=\"/Genesis.31.18\">31:18</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:7\" href=\"/Genesis.36.7\">36:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 35:3\" href=\"/Numbers.35.3\">Nu 35:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 35:7\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.35.7\">2 Ch 35:7</a>."}],"num":"2."},{"senses":[{"definition":"of stores, utensils, etc. <a data-ref=\"Genesis 46:6\" href=\"/Genesis.46.6\">Gn 46:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezra 1:4\" href=\"/Ezra.1.4\">Ezr 1:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezra 1:6\" href=\"/Ezra.1.6\">6</a>, as camp-baggage <a data-ref=\"Daniel 11:13\" href=\"/Daniel.11.13\">Dn 11:13</a>, especially as booty <a data-ref=\"Genesis 14:11\" href=\"/Genesis.14.11\">Gn 14:11</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 14:12\" href=\"/Genesis.14.12\">12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 14:16\" href=\"/Genesis.14.16\">16</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 14:21\" href=\"/Genesis.14.21\">21</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 20:25\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.20.25\">2 Ch 20:25</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 21:14\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.21.14\">21:14</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 21:17\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.21.17\">17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 11:24\" href=\"/Daniel.11.24\">Dn 11:24</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 11:28\" href=\"/Daniel.11.28\">28</a>."}],"num":"3."}]},"rid":"BDB09359","strong_numbers":["7399"],"next_hw":"רָם²","prev_hw":"רֶ֫כֶשׁ","all_cited":true,"alt_headwords":[{"word":"רְכֻשׁ"}],"quotes":[],"GK":["8214"],"TWOT":["2167b"],"parent_lexicon_details":{"name":"BDB Dictionary","language":"heb.biblical","to_language":"eng","text_categories":[],"source":"BDB Dictionary","attribution":"F. Brown, S. Driver & C. Briggs","index_title":"BDB","version_title":"A Hebrew and English lexicon of the Old Testament, by Francis Brown. With the co-operation of S. R. Driver and Charles A. Briggs. Oxford, 1906","version_lang":"en","should_autocomplete":true}}